1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,127
He's missing?

2
00:00:01,127 --> 00:00:03,295
Georgia told us that
Sir Teddy hasn't come home.

3
00:00:03,295 --> 00:00:05,715
The night we had dinner here,
I talked to Uncle Teddy.

4
00:00:05,715 --> 00:00:08,008
He said he'd come over,
but he never made it.

5
00:00:08,008 --> 00:00:10,428
The night he disappeared,
I saw you outside.

6
00:00:10,428 --> 00:00:12,513
Patricia, what are you
trying to imply?

7
00:00:12,513 --> 00:00:14,890
You say nothing,
yet you're accusing me.

8
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:17,226
Where is Sir Teddy?

9
00:00:17,226 --> 00:00:18,561
He's missing.

10
00:00:18,561 --> 00:00:20,646
And we suspect something bad
has happened to him.

11
00:00:20,646 --> 00:00:21,814
Diana, listen to me.

12
00:00:21,814 --> 00:00:23,649
Stay away from Ricardo.
He's dangerous.

13
00:00:23,649 --> 00:00:25,276
Ricardo is the son
of Cecilia Pineda.

14
00:00:25,276 --> 00:00:27,695
He wants us to pay for
what happened to his mother.

15
00:00:27,695 --> 00:00:31,031
Don't worry.
I'll get to your daughter next.

16
00:00:31,323 --> 00:00:32,324
Agh!

17
00:01:08,444 --> 00:01:09,487
I'm here.

18
00:02:28,274 --> 00:02:30,442
Goodbye, Diana.

19
00:04:02,284 --> 00:04:03,577
Dear, what is it?

20
00:04:04,703 --> 00:04:06,288
It's late.

21
00:04:06,288 --> 00:04:08,040
Why are you calling Ricardo?

22
00:04:08,791 --> 00:04:10,376
Why do you have a bruise, Pa?

23
00:04:11,377 --> 00:04:12,836
Uh, oh, this?

24
00:04:12,836 --> 00:04:14,546
It's nothing.
I just slipped outside.

25
00:04:15,339 --> 00:04:17,466
Tell me,
why are you calling Ricardo?

26
00:04:18,467 --> 00:04:20,260
Is there a problem
with your mom?

27
00:04:24,264 --> 00:04:26,392
We can't reach her phone.

28
00:04:27,810 --> 00:04:31,230
She's with Sir Ricardo,
and he won't pick up our calls.

29
00:04:32,189 --> 00:04:34,858
We don't even know
where they are.

30
00:04:34,858 --> 00:04:36,735
Uncle Teddy is also missing.

31
00:04:38,570 --> 00:04:41,156
Hold on, have you
reported this to the cops?

32
00:04:42,324 --> 00:04:44,868
Here we go again, you two.

33
00:04:44,868 --> 00:04:46,829
You're worrying too much.

34
00:04:46,829 --> 00:04:50,791
Diana and Ricardo
have done this before.

35
00:04:50,791 --> 00:04:52,001
They disappeared,

36
00:04:52,001 --> 00:04:55,295
and when they came back,
they were married.

37
00:04:55,295 --> 00:04:58,924
And I'm sure your Uncle Teddy's
just hiding from the law.

38
00:04:59,967 --> 00:05:01,468
My gut tells me
something's off, Pa.

39
00:05:02,344 --> 00:05:05,431
Uncle Teddy
has been missing for days.

40
00:05:05,431 --> 00:05:07,224
But before he went missing,
we talked.

41
00:05:07,224 --> 00:05:10,519
He said he had something
important to tell Mama.

42
00:05:11,020 --> 00:05:12,229
Then suddenly
he just disappeared.

43
00:05:12,229 --> 00:05:15,065
And now, Mama and Sir Ricardo
disappeared too.

44
00:05:15,941 --> 00:05:17,860
Hold on, that means...

45
00:05:18,736 --> 00:05:21,572
this may be all connected.

46
00:05:23,866 --> 00:05:25,617
Oh, Martin.

47
00:05:25,617 --> 00:05:29,997
Don't get crazy ideas
in your head.

48
00:05:29,997 --> 00:05:32,708
We've got plenty
of problems already.

49
00:05:32,708 --> 00:05:35,502
And if we don't fix
those problems,

50
00:05:35,502 --> 00:05:37,129
you'd sure be sorry, Martin.

51
00:06:29,139 --> 00:06:30,474
What are you doing here?

52
00:06:30,474 --> 00:06:32,059
What do you really need
from Sir Teddy?

53
00:06:33,268 --> 00:06:35,229
You went to La Familia
looking for him,

54
00:06:35,229 --> 00:06:36,897
but he wasn't there.

55
00:06:36,897 --> 00:06:38,565
You sure you haven't met
with him?

56
00:06:38,565 --> 00:06:40,359
I told you he owes me.

57
00:06:40,359 --> 00:06:42,611
But you've talked to Ricardo.

58
00:06:42,611 --> 00:06:43,821
Right?

59
00:06:43,821 --> 00:06:45,739
That seemed like
a really serious conversation.

60
00:06:45,739 --> 00:06:47,157
Just leave.

61
00:06:47,157 --> 00:06:48,200
Hold on, sir!

62
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,368
- How do you know Ricardo?!
- Leave!

63
00:07:17,104 --> 00:07:18,897
Alonzo Police Station.

64
00:07:18,897 --> 00:07:20,440
Sir, I need help.

65
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:22,734
What happened? Who's this?

66
00:07:23,235 --> 00:07:25,487
I'm Diana Aragon's husband, sir.

67
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:28,240
Sir, she's missing.

68
00:07:39,251 --> 00:07:41,253
Jun, I'll just go out for a bit.

69
00:07:41,253 --> 00:07:42,504
- Alright.
- If anyone comes,

70
00:07:42,504 --> 00:07:44,464
- let them wait in my office.
- Okay, sir.

71
00:07:58,061 --> 00:08:00,105
- Boss.
- Uh, yes?

72
00:08:00,105 --> 00:08:02,232
- This is Agila Silva, right?
- Yes, sir.

73
00:08:02,232 --> 00:08:03,358
I have an appointment.

74
00:08:03,358 --> 00:08:06,445
He just went out,
but he'll be back soon.

75
00:08:06,445 --> 00:08:07,738
- Is that so?
- Yes.

76
00:08:07,738 --> 00:08:09,239
Come inside.

77
00:08:09,239 --> 00:08:10,574
Oh, okay.

78
00:08:10,574 --> 00:08:11,867
- Alright.
- I'll just wait inside.

79
00:08:11,867 --> 00:08:12,868
Okay.

80
00:08:44,358 --> 00:08:45,984
"Ricardo Salvador"

81
00:08:52,366 --> 00:08:53,325
Bingo.

82
00:08:54,785 --> 00:08:55,953
What do you think you're doing?

83
00:08:55,953 --> 00:08:57,329
Uh, sir. Hold on.

84
00:08:57,329 --> 00:09:00,082
- I just want to talk, sir.
- Give me that.

85
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,475
Argh!

86
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:37,369
Argh!

87
00:09:40,372 --> 00:09:41,748
"RICARDO CALLING"

88
00:09:43,208 --> 00:09:44,376
Hello.

89
00:09:44,376 --> 00:09:46,044
Hello, Patricia.

90
00:09:46,044 --> 00:09:47,587
Sir Ricardo,
what's really going on?

91
00:09:47,587 --> 00:09:49,298
Why can't I reach you and Mama?

92
00:09:50,549 --> 00:09:51,967
Sir Ricardo.

93
00:09:53,135 --> 00:09:56,680
Patricia,
something happened to your mom.

94
00:09:57,514 --> 00:09:58,807
What happened to Mama?

95
00:10:15,449 --> 00:10:16,992
Whoo!

96
00:10:22,205 --> 00:10:25,334
A search party is still ongoing

97
00:10:25,334 --> 00:10:28,337
for La Familia CEO,
Diana Aragon.

98
00:10:28,337 --> 00:10:29,838
- As per the police,
- Ma!

99
00:10:29,838 --> 00:10:31,631
she's been missing for 24 hours

100
00:10:31,631 --> 00:10:33,550
since her husband,
Ricardo Salvador,

101
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:35,052
reported her disappearance.

102
00:10:38,638 --> 00:10:39,765
Let's look over there.

103
00:10:41,850 --> 00:10:42,851
Patricia.

104
00:10:45,771 --> 00:10:46,938
Get some rest.

105
00:10:47,731 --> 00:10:48,815
Diana!

106
00:10:53,403 --> 00:10:54,571
Diana!

107
00:11:17,761 --> 00:11:18,970
Sir, you can't go any further.

108
00:11:18,970 --> 00:11:20,222
You can't come in, sir.

109
00:11:20,222 --> 00:11:21,556
Let me in.
My daughter's there.

110
00:11:21,556 --> 00:11:23,141
Sir, I'm sorry. You can't go in.

111
00:11:23,141 --> 00:11:25,352
- No, I need to go in there!
- Sir, please.

112
00:11:25,352 --> 00:11:26,937
- Patricia!
- Sir, come on.

113
00:11:26,937 --> 00:11:29,022
Bye, sir. Thank you. Take care!

114
00:11:49,543 --> 00:11:50,836
Ma.

115
00:11:50,836 --> 00:11:52,838
Good thing you're home.

116
00:11:52,838 --> 00:11:53,880
- Ma.
- Why?

117
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:56,383
Where is your father?

118
00:11:56,383 --> 00:11:58,176
Papa went out.

119
00:11:58,176 --> 00:11:59,970
He came to see Patricia.

120
00:11:59,970 --> 00:12:02,722
He went to help find
Patricia's mom.

121
00:12:04,099 --> 00:12:06,059
My daughter is in there!
Patricia!

122
00:12:06,059 --> 00:12:07,352
- Pa!
- You can't go in, sir.

123
00:12:08,061 --> 00:12:09,062
Patricia.

124
00:12:12,524 --> 00:12:14,860
Dear, any updates on your mom?

125
00:12:15,902 --> 00:12:16,903
Nothing yet.

126
00:12:18,238 --> 00:12:20,866
It's always about Diana!

127
00:12:20,866 --> 00:12:23,160
Ma, what should we do?

128
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:26,913
Patricia and Papa
aren't answering our calls.

129
00:12:30,584 --> 00:12:32,085
Pack your things.

130
00:12:34,671 --> 00:12:36,465
Why, Ma?
Where are we going?

131
00:12:38,133 --> 00:12:41,178
Nothing's more important
to your dad

132
00:12:41,178 --> 00:12:43,388
than Diana and Patricia!

133
00:12:43,388 --> 00:12:45,223
Don't you see that?!

134
00:12:46,933 --> 00:12:51,062
I gave him plenty of chances!

135
00:12:51,062 --> 00:12:53,815
But looks like he already
made his choice!

136
00:12:53,815 --> 00:12:55,775
But, Ma, where will we stay?

137
00:12:55,775 --> 00:12:59,446
Oh, Jena, stop complaining!

138
00:12:59,446 --> 00:13:02,199
Just pack your things! Hurry up!

139
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:13,418
Carlota!

140
00:13:13,418 --> 00:13:16,505
Oh. You left this in my car.

141
00:13:16,505 --> 00:13:17,506
Oh.

142
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:21,510
Oh... What happened?

143
00:13:34,648 --> 00:13:35,857
Thank you, sir.

144
00:13:53,375 --> 00:13:55,710
Sir, what do you think
really happened?

145
00:13:55,710 --> 00:13:58,296
Does the person who threatened
her life have to do with this?

146
00:13:58,296 --> 00:14:00,090
Could that be it?

147
00:14:00,090 --> 00:14:04,678
We all know many people
want to ruin Diana.

148
00:14:05,470 --> 00:14:10,183
The police are already
investigating suspects.

149
00:14:10,183 --> 00:14:12,978
And I'm closely monitoring
the investigation myself.

150
00:14:14,229 --> 00:14:16,856
We are appealing to the public
for assistance.

151
00:14:16,856 --> 00:14:20,443
If you have information
on Diana's whereabouts,

152
00:14:21,695 --> 00:14:23,863
please reach out to us.

153
00:14:24,197 --> 00:14:26,157
If Ma'am Diana Aragon
is listening right now,

154
00:14:26,157 --> 00:14:28,535
is there anything
you'd like to say to her?

155
00:14:28,535 --> 00:14:29,578
Diana.

156
00:14:31,329 --> 00:14:32,872
I love you so much.

157
00:14:33,915 --> 00:14:36,167
We won't stop looking for you.

158
00:14:37,335 --> 00:14:38,920
I hope you come home soon.

159
00:14:39,838 --> 00:14:42,007
That's all
the information we have.

160
00:14:42,007 --> 00:14:43,925
- Sir, we need--
- We'll get back to you.

161
00:14:43,925 --> 00:14:45,677
- We need more details, sir!
- That's all we have for now.

162
00:14:45,677 --> 00:14:47,679
Sir, please tell us
more details!

163
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:51,683
May we request for an interview?
Please, sir!

164
00:14:51,683 --> 00:14:54,686
We just want more information.
Sir, please!

165
00:14:55,979 --> 00:14:57,564
Ma'am, sir...

166
00:14:57,564 --> 00:15:01,067
It has been 48 hours since
the search operation began.

167
00:15:01,067 --> 00:15:04,571
Due to heavy rains,
there has been a huge landslide.

168
00:15:04,571 --> 00:15:08,074
For now, we need
to suspend the search.

169
00:15:08,074 --> 00:15:10,076
Sir, we haven't found
my wife yet!

170
00:15:10,076 --> 00:15:11,286
I'm sorry.

171
00:15:11,286 --> 00:15:13,788
For now, our team will
continue their search

172
00:15:13,788 --> 00:15:15,373
on areas that
we can still access.

173
00:15:15,373 --> 00:15:16,499
But sir!

174
00:15:16,499 --> 00:15:18,877
That's more reason to search
all over the place right now!

175
00:15:18,877 --> 00:15:21,880
What if my wife was harmed
by that landslide?

176
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,381
Are we going
to do nothing here?!

177
00:15:23,381 --> 00:15:24,591
I understand.

178
00:15:24,591 --> 00:15:27,594
No, you don't because
she's not your wife!

179
00:15:27,594 --> 00:15:32,599
Sir, we can't risk
the lives of my search team.

180
00:15:32,599 --> 00:15:33,767
It's risky.

181
00:15:34,184 --> 00:15:35,977
When are you going to
continue the search?

182
00:15:35,977 --> 00:15:37,354
When it's safer.

183
00:15:37,354 --> 00:15:39,564
We will check the perimeter
around the safe areas.

184
00:15:39,564 --> 00:15:41,399
We can't just
stand idly by, sir!

185
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:43,193
My wife is missing!

186
00:15:44,319 --> 00:15:46,112
Look for her!

187
00:16:07,967 --> 00:16:11,971
Ma!

188
00:16:13,848 --> 00:16:16,976
Mama!

189
00:16:17,602 --> 00:16:19,979
Ma!

190
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,609
Patricia...

191
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:31,199
Perhaps it would be better
if you head home.

192
00:16:33,076 --> 00:16:34,786
I'll just let you know
if there is an update

193
00:16:34,786 --> 00:16:36,287
on the search operation.

194
00:16:38,790 --> 00:16:40,542
Where did
you take my mother?

195
00:16:41,084 --> 00:16:42,502
What did you do to her?

196
00:16:42,502 --> 00:16:44,295
Why are you blaming me?

197
00:16:44,295 --> 00:16:47,090
Because you're the last person
with her!

198
00:16:48,383 --> 00:16:50,760
First,
it was Uncle Teddy.

199
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,595
And now, Mama's gone.

200
00:16:52,595 --> 00:16:53,763
Fine.

201
00:16:55,014 --> 00:16:56,516
Blame it all on me!

202
00:16:57,517 --> 00:16:59,519
Yes, it's my fault!

203
00:17:00,979 --> 00:17:02,981
If only I watched out
for her...

204
00:17:03,773 --> 00:17:05,692
If I had taken
better care of her,

205
00:17:05,692 --> 00:17:07,193
then she wouldn't be missing!

206
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:15,243
Patricia, you don't know
how much I blame myself.

207
00:17:17,662 --> 00:17:20,665
I promised your mother
that I would protect her.

208
00:17:22,250 --> 00:17:24,461
I won't fall for your act.

209
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,882
I will find Mama
and Uncle Teddy.

210
00:17:29,799 --> 00:17:31,593
And whatever your plan is,

211
00:17:31,593 --> 00:17:34,596
I will make sure
you don't succeed!

212
00:17:50,570 --> 00:17:52,071
Because of the landslide,

213
00:17:52,071 --> 00:17:55,283
the authorities temporarily
halted their search

214
00:17:55,283 --> 00:17:58,077
for the missing businesswoman,
Diana Aragon.

215
00:17:58,077 --> 00:18:00,497
Meanwhile, people are still
figuring out if she went missing

216
00:18:00,497 --> 00:18:02,499
due to an accident or
if there was foul play involved.

217
00:18:02,499 --> 00:18:04,959
Hey, that's enough!

218
00:18:04,959 --> 00:18:07,796
Mr. Smith already took us out
for dinner,

219
00:18:07,796 --> 00:18:10,590
so why are you still
bothering yourselves with that?

220
00:18:10,590 --> 00:18:12,592
Your taking his treat
for granted.

221
00:18:12,592 --> 00:18:14,594
You're embarrassing me.
Stop watching that already.

222
00:18:14,594 --> 00:18:19,098
We're watching the interview
of Ma'am Diana's husband.

223
00:18:19,098 --> 00:18:20,475
What could have happened to her?

224
00:18:20,475 --> 00:18:22,268
I don't care.

225
00:18:22,268 --> 00:18:26,272
I'm sure Martin is regretting
what he did to me.

226
00:18:27,565 --> 00:18:28,775
Carlota!

227
00:18:28,775 --> 00:18:30,193
- Carlota!
- Pa! Pa!

228
00:18:30,193 --> 00:18:31,694
You can't come in here!

229
00:18:31,694 --> 00:18:33,696
I'm here to take my children
with me.

230
00:18:33,696 --> 00:18:35,281
- Get off me!
- Hey!

231
00:18:35,281 --> 00:18:37,659
What are you doing here, huh?

232
00:18:37,659 --> 00:18:38,868
Come on, let's go home.

233
00:18:38,868 --> 00:18:40,870
- Let's go.
- Let go of me!

234
00:18:41,579 --> 00:18:43,373
Don't you have any shame?

235
00:18:43,373 --> 00:18:46,376
How could you bring my children
to another man's house?!

236
00:18:48,670 --> 00:18:51,673
How dare you have
the nerve to get jealous?

237
00:18:51,673 --> 00:18:53,591
Why? Are we married?

238
00:18:53,591 --> 00:18:56,386
Leave! Go to Diana!

239
00:18:56,386 --> 00:18:58,263
That's if you find her.

240
00:18:58,263 --> 00:19:00,265
Why are you bringing Diana
into this again?

241
00:19:00,265 --> 00:19:01,933
Because you've been
bringing that woman

242
00:19:01,933 --> 00:19:03,560
into our lives
for a long time now.

243
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:05,395
You know,
even if you don't say it,

244
00:19:05,395 --> 00:19:08,982
I'm sure that if something
happens to Diana and Patricia,

245
00:19:08,982 --> 00:19:11,693
you're going to turn around
and leave us.

246
00:19:11,693 --> 00:19:13,486
Should I even wait
for that to happen?

247
00:19:13,486 --> 00:19:17,699
Do you think I'll still let you
be with my children?

248
00:19:17,699 --> 00:19:19,659
What are you saying?
Use your head!

249
00:19:20,243 --> 00:19:21,744
What's going on here?

250
00:19:22,287 --> 00:19:23,496
Carlota?

251
00:19:23,496 --> 00:19:24,998
I'm bringing home
my family!

252
00:19:24,998 --> 00:19:26,958
- We're not going home with you!
- Come on.

253
00:19:26,958 --> 00:19:29,627
You better leave
before I call the police.

254
00:19:29,627 --> 00:19:31,629
Hey, don't meddle here!

255
00:19:31,629 --> 00:19:33,131
This is my family.

256
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:37,594
Now, if you don't want
to go home, I don't care.

257
00:19:37,594 --> 00:19:40,096
But I'm taking my children
with me.

258
00:19:40,096 --> 00:19:41,890
- Let's go.
- Wait.

259
00:19:41,890 --> 00:19:44,893
Give it a try,
and I'll fight you!

260
00:19:46,686 --> 00:19:50,690
You said we were guilty.

261
00:19:50,690 --> 00:19:52,191
When the truth comes out,

262
00:19:52,191 --> 00:19:56,195
what do you think will
your beloved Patricia say?

263
00:19:58,448 --> 00:19:59,991
Let them go!

264
00:20:06,998 --> 00:20:08,791
I'll come back for you, kids.

265
00:20:13,087 --> 00:20:14,297
Move!

266
00:20:19,218 --> 00:20:20,386
Ricardo.

267
00:20:20,762 --> 00:20:22,263
Attorney, please sit down.

268
00:20:22,847 --> 00:20:25,475
I was waiting for you to send me
the signed prenup.

269
00:20:25,475 --> 00:20:27,518
Diana and I wanted
to talk with you.

270
00:20:27,518 --> 00:20:30,313
But so much has happened
in the last few days.

271
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:34,150
Diana and I had decided to not
push through with the prenup.

272
00:20:34,609 --> 00:20:36,611
And while she hasn't
been found yet...

273
00:20:37,487 --> 00:20:41,491
I want to make sure her assets
and properties are secured.

274
00:20:41,908 --> 00:20:43,701
She granted me authority.

275
00:20:45,703 --> 00:20:48,122
Special Power of Attorney
signed by Diana.

276
00:20:57,090 --> 00:20:59,300
You want me to act on this?

277
00:20:59,592 --> 00:21:01,094
I just want to make sure that

278
00:21:01,094 --> 00:21:03,972
her assets are alright
while she's gone.

279
00:21:06,516 --> 00:21:07,850
Is there a problem?

280
00:21:08,768 --> 00:21:12,105
It might be better to wait
until we find Diana.

281
00:21:13,606 --> 00:21:15,108
Okay.

282
00:21:17,944 --> 00:21:19,445
I have no problem with that.

283
00:21:20,029 --> 00:21:21,489
Not unless...

284
00:21:21,990 --> 00:21:25,493
you want your husband to
know about your boy toy.

285
00:21:36,838 --> 00:21:38,840
The authorities
swore that...

286
00:21:39,173 --> 00:21:43,261
they wouldn't stop looking
for my wife, Diana.

287
00:21:44,178 --> 00:21:47,181
My heart feels very heavy...

288
00:21:47,181 --> 00:21:48,975
seeing you all like this.

289
00:21:52,687 --> 00:21:57,442
You're all worried for the woman
who you also see as your mother.

290
00:21:58,818 --> 00:22:02,071
As her husband,
my worries are double that.

291
00:22:04,115 --> 00:22:06,492
The same goes for Patricia,
her daughter.

292
00:22:07,201 --> 00:22:09,412
As well as her niece, Georgia.

293
00:22:10,038 --> 00:22:12,749
But we're grateful to you all.

294
00:22:13,916 --> 00:22:18,379
I hope you continue...
praying for her.

295
00:22:22,967 --> 00:22:24,469
We all know that...

296
00:22:25,011 --> 00:22:27,138
If Diana were here now...

297
00:22:30,475 --> 00:22:31,684
there'd be one thing...

298
00:22:32,685 --> 00:22:34,187
There'd be one thing
that she would want.

299
00:22:36,189 --> 00:22:38,691
She'd want us to carry on.

300
00:22:40,902 --> 00:22:42,403
Liar!

301
00:22:45,406 --> 00:22:48,993
I won't let you carry on
until you return my mother!

302
00:22:53,164 --> 00:22:54,832
Patricia, please. Not here.

303
00:22:54,832 --> 00:22:56,000
Why not?

304
00:22:56,834 --> 00:22:59,337
Say it in front of all of us!

305
00:22:59,337 --> 00:23:01,130
Where did you take my mother?

306
00:23:01,130 --> 00:23:04,258
What did you do to her
and to Uncle Teddy?!

307
00:23:06,886 --> 00:23:08,930
Let's give order
to this meeting.

308
00:23:09,430 --> 00:23:12,767
Ms. Dela Cruz,
please calm down.

309
00:23:13,392 --> 00:23:14,393
Calm down.

310
00:23:14,393 --> 00:23:15,895
Patricia, sit down first.

311
00:23:16,479 --> 00:23:17,980
Patricia. Come on.

312
00:23:17,980 --> 00:23:20,608
Mr. Salvador, thank you.

313
00:23:25,488 --> 00:23:29,200
And now, someone wants
to speak to all of La Familia.

314
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:32,578
Someone we haven't
seen in a long time.

315
00:23:32,578 --> 00:23:37,250
He contacted us earlier and
requested for an audience.

316
00:23:41,170 --> 00:23:42,380
Daddy?

317
00:23:42,380 --> 00:23:43,965
Mr. Aragon?

318
00:23:43,965 --> 00:23:46,134
Everyone is listening
to you now.

319
00:23:48,052 --> 00:23:49,554
Good afternoon, everyone.

320
00:23:50,471 --> 00:23:52,765
I'm sorry I cannot
be there right now.

321
00:23:52,765 --> 00:23:55,309
And I'm sorry...

322
00:23:55,768 --> 00:23:58,229
for not saying goodbye
to my daughter and my family.

323
00:23:59,355 --> 00:24:02,400
With how much has happened
in my life lately,

324
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:04,277
I had to go out of the country.

325
00:24:04,861 --> 00:24:06,362
I needed some time to think.

326
00:24:07,613 --> 00:24:10,491
To reflect on my actions...

327
00:24:11,284 --> 00:24:12,785
on my sins...

328
00:24:17,623 --> 00:24:19,083
I'm very sorry...

329
00:24:20,042 --> 00:24:22,044
for everything I did
to the company.

330
00:24:23,629 --> 00:24:25,464
Everything I was accused of,

331
00:24:26,174 --> 00:24:29,510
as well as the secret transfer
of the company's money...

332
00:24:30,303 --> 00:24:31,804
It's all true.

333
00:24:37,602 --> 00:24:40,104
But I didn't do it alone.

334
00:24:41,063 --> 00:24:42,273
The truth is that...

335
00:24:44,692 --> 00:24:47,028
I was just following orders.

336
00:24:49,780 --> 00:24:51,199
Is it Sir Ricardo?

337
00:24:52,533 --> 00:24:53,743
Daddy hates him.

338
00:24:55,703 --> 00:24:57,496
He will not obey Ricardo.

339
00:24:58,706 --> 00:24:59,832
Teddy, please!

340
00:25:00,625 --> 00:25:02,627
Tell us who ordered you
to do it.

341
00:25:03,211 --> 00:25:04,837
So we can hold
them accountable!

342
00:25:08,507 --> 00:25:10,343
The person who really
told me to do it...

343
00:25:11,719 --> 00:25:13,221
was Diana.

344
00:25:14,138 --> 00:25:16,349
She was the one
who made me do it.

345
00:25:18,726 --> 00:25:23,731
The brains behind all of this
is Diana Aragon.

346
00:25:23,731 --> 00:25:25,233
That's not true.

347
00:25:26,025 --> 00:25:28,361
My mother could never do that
to La Familia.

348
00:25:28,945 --> 00:25:33,616
Uncle Teddy, you know how hard
Mama has worked for this!

349
00:25:34,158 --> 00:25:35,201
For you!

350
00:25:35,201 --> 00:25:37,870
For all of us here
in La Familia!

351
00:25:37,870 --> 00:25:39,121
Dad, please!

352
00:25:40,498 --> 00:25:41,832
Tell the truth.

353
00:25:41,832 --> 00:25:44,168
No, Georgia! That is the truth!

354
00:25:44,168 --> 00:25:45,503
Teddy!

355
00:25:45,503 --> 00:25:47,713
Don't throw accusations
so lightly!

356
00:25:47,713 --> 00:25:48,798
No.

357
00:25:48,798 --> 00:25:50,508
La Familia has been losing money
for a while now,

358
00:25:50,508 --> 00:25:52,718
and Diana has been deceiving us
for years.

359
00:25:53,219 --> 00:25:54,512
I have all the evidence.

360
00:25:54,512 --> 00:25:57,098
She gradually transferred
the operating funds

361
00:25:57,098 --> 00:25:58,933
to her personal accounts.

362
00:25:58,933 --> 00:26:02,061
She's taking away all the money
before the company collapses.

363
00:26:02,061 --> 00:26:03,437
I can't take it anymore.

364
00:26:03,437 --> 00:26:06,983
She's squeezing La Familia dry
and I can't take it anymore.

365
00:26:06,983 --> 00:26:08,901
I can't let her keep using me,

366
00:26:08,901 --> 00:26:11,362
and my conscience
can't handle it anymore.

367
00:26:20,204 --> 00:26:21,872
Okay. See you guys.

368
00:26:23,582 --> 00:26:24,792
Sir Ricardo.

369
00:26:27,545 --> 00:26:29,922
I don't know why
Teddy said all those things.

370
00:26:30,464 --> 00:26:31,757
But I'll get
to the bottom of this.

371
00:26:32,508 --> 00:26:34,176
I don't believe him.

372
00:26:35,052 --> 00:26:37,013
It was as if someone
was pressuring him.

373
00:26:37,805 --> 00:26:39,307
He was being blackmailed.

374
00:26:39,307 --> 00:26:41,475
Patricia, I think I know
where this is going.

375
00:26:42,768 --> 00:26:45,521
But I won't let you throw
accusations at me again.

376
00:26:46,147 --> 00:26:48,190
You saw your Uncle Teddy
with your own eyes.

377
00:26:48,190 --> 00:26:50,151
He's abroad,
living the good life.

378
00:26:51,360 --> 00:26:52,778
Did he look like someone
who was being blackmailed?

379
00:26:53,195 --> 00:26:55,448
I still don't have
the full picture.

380
00:26:55,448 --> 00:26:58,159
A lot of things haven't been
making sense lately,

381
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:00,911
but they all seem to be...

382
00:27:02,079 --> 00:27:03,748
connected to you.

383
00:27:04,373 --> 00:27:07,835
Listen to me, Patricia.
I've been very patient with you

384
00:27:07,835 --> 00:27:09,754
because you're Diana's daughter.

385
00:27:11,881 --> 00:27:13,591
But don't push me too far.

386
00:27:15,634 --> 00:27:17,428
I have my limits.

387
00:27:17,428 --> 00:27:18,846
Are you threatening me?

388
00:27:19,263 --> 00:27:22,058
What happens
when your patience runs out?

389
00:27:23,309 --> 00:27:25,102
Will I just disappear, too?

390
00:28:14,443 --> 00:28:15,528
Ma.

391
00:28:15,986 --> 00:28:17,196
Can we talk?

392
00:28:17,196 --> 00:28:19,240
We have nothing to talk about.

393
00:28:19,949 --> 00:28:21,617
Maybe not about us.
But you and Papa--

394
00:28:21,617 --> 00:28:23,786
What exactly do you want?

395
00:28:25,329 --> 00:28:27,581
Does it really have
to come to this?

396
00:28:28,874 --> 00:28:31,502
He is still the father
of April and Jena.

397
00:28:32,670 --> 00:28:34,797
Maybe you can still fix this.

398
00:28:34,797 --> 00:28:36,507
Well, what if I don't want to?

399
00:28:36,966 --> 00:28:38,092
What then?

400
00:28:38,843 --> 00:28:41,137
I don't want to leave
my daughters

401
00:28:41,137 --> 00:28:42,596
to their irresponsible father.

402
00:28:43,097 --> 00:28:45,683
I know my dad made a lot
of mistakes.

403
00:28:45,683 --> 00:28:47,101
At least you can admit that.

404
00:28:47,476 --> 00:28:49,687
- He has a lot of shortcomings.
- Mmm.

405
00:28:49,687 --> 00:28:53,858
But we both know that
he loves my sisters so much.

406
00:28:55,109 --> 00:28:58,362
And I'm sure they want
to be with our father.

407
00:28:59,071 --> 00:29:00,698
You're so good at this.

408
00:29:01,407 --> 00:29:04,618
Are you saying that
I'm the bad guy again?

409
00:29:04,618 --> 00:29:05,661
My point is,

410
00:29:05,661 --> 00:29:07,997
my father needs you
by his side right now.

411
00:29:07,997 --> 00:29:09,415
That's unfair.

412
00:29:09,748 --> 00:29:12,877
He was nowhere to be found
when I needed him.

413
00:29:19,091 --> 00:29:20,342
Mr. Smith.

414
00:29:21,302 --> 00:29:22,428
Ricardo.

415
00:29:23,012 --> 00:29:24,513
I've been meaning
to meet with you

416
00:29:24,513 --> 00:29:26,098
to discuss some matters.

417
00:29:26,098 --> 00:29:27,892
What would that be about?

418
00:29:27,892 --> 00:29:29,518
Well, I thought
you'd be interested

419
00:29:29,518 --> 00:29:31,353
in acquiring company shares.

420
00:29:32,062 --> 00:29:33,230
Why would I do that?

421
00:29:33,230 --> 00:29:35,733
Well, it will give you
and Burger City

422
00:29:35,733 --> 00:29:38,694
a great advantage in the
Philippines in the future.

423
00:29:38,694 --> 00:29:40,488
I mean, imagine being
a shareholder

424
00:29:40,488 --> 00:29:42,990
of one of the largest companies
in the country.

425
00:29:42,990 --> 00:29:44,658
With what's happening?

426
00:29:44,658 --> 00:29:47,161
Well, the real people behind
La Familia's downfall

427
00:29:47,203 --> 00:29:48,537
are out of the picture.

428
00:29:48,537 --> 00:29:50,164
I mean, you've seen me work.

429
00:29:50,539 --> 00:29:52,708
You know I can make
La Familia great again.

430
00:29:53,292 --> 00:29:56,754
All I need is your shares
and your cooperation.

431
00:29:58,088 --> 00:30:00,382
And how would I benefit
from this?

432
00:30:00,382 --> 00:30:02,968
I guarantee I can make
you a wealthier man.

433
00:30:03,677 --> 00:30:04,678
How's that?

434
00:30:05,262 --> 00:30:06,430
I'll think about it.

435
00:30:06,722 --> 00:30:07,765
Great.

436
00:30:43,968 --> 00:30:46,762
"You're going to pay
for what you did!"

437
00:30:56,272 --> 00:30:58,566
"You're going to pay
for what you did!"

438
00:31:36,604 --> 00:31:39,023
Mama!

439
00:32:28,614 --> 00:32:29,782
Enzo.

440
00:32:36,246 --> 00:32:38,082
Got any idea where Patricia is?

441
00:32:38,082 --> 00:32:39,583
I've been looking for her.

442
00:32:40,084 --> 00:32:41,418
What do you need from her?

443
00:32:42,878 --> 00:32:45,047
Do you know
what she's doing now?

444
00:32:45,047 --> 00:32:46,757
Aside from her work duties?

445
00:32:47,424 --> 00:32:49,551
She catches up with her studies.
That's all.

446
00:32:49,551 --> 00:32:50,928
Are you sure?

447
00:32:51,428 --> 00:32:53,305
You're not conspiring with her
against me?

448
00:32:54,598 --> 00:32:57,184
Be careful which side
you choose, Enzo.

449
00:32:57,518 --> 00:32:58,477
Who?

450
00:32:59,061 --> 00:33:00,396
Patricia?

451
00:33:02,439 --> 00:33:04,400
Is she really the one
I should be careful around?

452
00:33:05,567 --> 00:33:08,320
I will give you a chance
to support me.

453
00:33:08,946 --> 00:33:12,199
Let's work together
to save La Familia.

454
00:33:12,199 --> 00:33:13,325
Save?

455
00:33:17,746 --> 00:33:19,206
Save or destroy?

456
00:33:19,581 --> 00:33:22,918
Blind loyalty is just stupidity
in disguise.

457
00:33:23,836 --> 00:33:24,837
Why?

458
00:33:24,837 --> 00:33:26,588
How well do you know Diana?

459
00:33:27,798 --> 00:33:29,425
How well do you know
your girlfriend?

460
00:33:30,175 --> 00:33:31,927
Are you seriously trying
to turn me against them?

461
00:33:34,763 --> 00:33:36,098
That's not going
to work anymore.

462
00:33:37,641 --> 00:33:39,727
Because I finally know
who you really are.

463
00:33:40,769 --> 00:33:42,938
You are the son
of Cecilia Pineda.

464
00:33:47,526 --> 00:33:50,070
There's a lot you don't know
about what happened.

465
00:33:51,739 --> 00:33:53,323
What are you talking about?

466
00:34:01,248 --> 00:34:02,374
What's this?

467
00:34:08,046 --> 00:34:11,759
Why did you have to lie? Why?

468
00:34:11,759 --> 00:34:13,677
To protect you!

469
00:34:14,678 --> 00:34:18,182
I knew they'd keep looking
for someone to blame

470
00:34:18,182 --> 00:34:19,600
for what happened.

471
00:34:19,600 --> 00:34:21,810
And because you're an Aragon,

472
00:34:21,810 --> 00:34:24,313
you'd be the easiest target.

473
00:34:24,855 --> 00:34:28,609
And I couldn't risk them
destroying you

474
00:34:28,609 --> 00:34:31,153
just so they could close
the case.

475
00:34:31,779 --> 00:34:34,156
I wanted to keep you out of it.

476
00:34:35,282 --> 00:34:37,993
They ruined my mother's life.

477
00:34:38,619 --> 00:34:40,287
She was also a victim.

478
00:34:40,287 --> 00:34:44,416
Diana made her the scapegoat
for the fire in La Familia

479
00:34:45,042 --> 00:34:47,628
...to protect
her daughter, Patricia.

480
00:34:49,046 --> 00:34:50,464
Do you still think...

481
00:34:50,464 --> 00:34:53,550
I have no right
to seek justice for my mother?

482
00:34:59,264 --> 00:35:00,641
If you think about it...

483
00:35:01,099 --> 00:35:02,768
To this day,
there is still no justice

484
00:35:02,768 --> 00:35:04,603
for the death of your parents.

485
00:35:04,603 --> 00:35:06,939
And that is Diana's doing.

486
00:35:08,148 --> 00:35:10,150
All to protect Patricia.

487
00:35:13,445 --> 00:35:17,199
Mommy! Mommy!

488
00:35:46,103 --> 00:35:47,521
Enzo.

489
00:35:49,815 --> 00:35:50,983
Did something happen?

490
00:35:51,483 --> 00:35:52,609
Come in.

491
00:35:58,699 --> 00:36:02,077
Did you see the files
of Uncle Teddy's investigator?

492
00:36:02,119 --> 00:36:03,495
Did you discover anything?

493
00:36:05,664 --> 00:36:09,001
- Enzo.
- Tell me the truth, Patricia.

494
00:36:09,001 --> 00:36:10,878
What did you not tell me before?

495
00:36:11,253 --> 00:36:13,005
When you talked
with that former employee?

496
00:36:13,964 --> 00:36:16,341
What did he say
about the fire in the factory?

497
00:36:17,092 --> 00:36:20,220
- Enzo...
- You know what Miss D did.

498
00:36:21,763 --> 00:36:24,558
You know what she did
to the investigation.

499
00:36:26,059 --> 00:36:27,895
Did you lie to me, Patricia?

500
00:36:31,148 --> 00:36:32,608
Why can't you answer?

501
00:36:34,276 --> 00:36:37,112
I didn't want to hide it
to you, but--

502
00:36:37,112 --> 00:36:40,324
So you just lied to me? Why?!

503
00:36:47,539 --> 00:36:49,791
Because of Mama.

504
00:36:50,667 --> 00:36:52,628
She wanted to protect me.

505
00:36:55,422 --> 00:36:57,090
Protect you?

506
00:37:01,511 --> 00:37:03,388
You caused the fire
in the factory.

507
00:37:08,185 --> 00:37:11,772
She didn't want me
to be blamed.

508
00:37:15,108 --> 00:37:18,111
But no. Enzo, no.

509
00:37:19,488 --> 00:37:24,534
I'm certain I didn't cause
the fire, believe me.

510
00:37:36,713 --> 00:37:37,923
If that is true...

511
00:37:39,925 --> 00:37:41,551
and if Miss D believed you...

512
00:37:43,011 --> 00:37:45,138
Why did she have to manipulate
the investigation?

513
00:37:46,056 --> 00:37:47,891
Because she was scared.

514
00:37:50,686 --> 00:37:53,313
She knew everyone
would pin the blame on me

515
00:37:53,313 --> 00:37:56,400
if they found out
I was in the factory.

516
00:37:58,443 --> 00:38:00,862
She just didn't want
to destroy my life.

517
00:38:06,118 --> 00:38:09,705
I wanted to know
who was really behind the fire,

518
00:38:09,705 --> 00:38:11,623
so I didn't tell you anything.

519
00:38:12,624 --> 00:38:15,002
Or maybe
you just don't trust me.

520
00:38:15,502 --> 00:38:17,421
I knew you'd get hurt.

521
00:38:18,755 --> 00:38:21,216
I knew you'd get mad at Mama.

522
00:38:24,344 --> 00:38:26,555
I know you treat her as family.

523
00:38:26,555 --> 00:38:29,516
I know how important
she is to you!

524
00:38:30,434 --> 00:38:31,727
Family, Patricia?

525
00:38:32,936 --> 00:38:34,438
I don't have a family anymore.

526
00:38:35,105 --> 00:38:37,274
I lost my parents in that fire!

527
00:38:39,026 --> 00:38:40,694
My entire life...

528
00:38:40,694 --> 00:38:43,196
I thought there was justice
for their deaths,

529
00:38:43,196 --> 00:38:44,781
but there wasn't.
There still isn't.

530
00:38:47,117 --> 00:38:49,119
Don't you think
I deserve the truth?

531
00:38:50,370 --> 00:38:53,290
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

532
00:38:54,624 --> 00:38:57,002
I gave my whole life
to La Familia!

533
00:38:59,337 --> 00:39:00,839
But that still wasn't enough.

534
00:39:03,300 --> 00:39:04,384
That was all for nothing.

535
00:39:04,968 --> 00:39:06,678
'Cause everything was a lie!

536
00:39:14,269 --> 00:39:16,646
I understand how you feel.

537
00:39:17,606 --> 00:39:21,443
But I can't put Mama in danger.

538
00:40:11,493 --> 00:40:13,912
Argh!

539
00:40:38,895 --> 00:40:41,898
I heard your conversation
with Mr. Smith.

540
00:40:42,816 --> 00:40:46,361
You offered him to become
a shareholder of La Familia.

541
00:40:46,361 --> 00:40:47,904
He hasn't responded yet,
has he?

542
00:40:48,196 --> 00:40:50,866
- I can help you.
- Why?

543
00:40:53,535 --> 00:40:56,746
It just looks like
you need some help.

544
00:40:56,746 --> 00:40:59,958
You may not be aware,
but I'm close with Mr. Smith.

545
00:41:00,458 --> 00:41:01,918
And what will you get in return?

546
00:41:03,920 --> 00:41:06,173
You want to get back
at Diana? Hm?

547
00:41:07,841 --> 00:41:10,010
Let's say I do agree.

548
00:41:11,178 --> 00:41:14,139
How can you help me
when you're just a secretary?

549
00:41:16,558 --> 00:41:21,354
This secretary might just be
the solution to your problems.

550
00:41:26,318 --> 00:41:27,861
Think about it, sir.

551
00:41:48,131 --> 00:41:49,257
Going up!

552
00:41:56,389 --> 00:41:57,390
Enzo.

553
00:42:30,382 --> 00:42:31,424
Ma?

554
00:42:41,351 --> 00:42:42,394
Carl.

555
00:42:42,936 --> 00:42:44,271
Rob, what are you guys
doing here?

556
00:42:44,771 --> 00:42:46,231
We're just taking orders, ma'am.

557
00:42:49,359 --> 00:42:50,777
I'm the one who instructed them.

558
00:42:52,153 --> 00:42:53,196
Why?

559
00:42:54,364 --> 00:42:56,533
Do you think
Mama won't come back?

560
00:42:57,867 --> 00:42:59,953
- Could you give us the room?
- Alright, sir.

561
00:43:09,004 --> 00:43:11,881
Why do you seem so sure?

562
00:43:11,881 --> 00:43:14,259
You seem to know
what happened to her.

563
00:43:15,385 --> 00:43:18,305
Instead of looking for her,
this is what you're doing.

564
00:43:18,305 --> 00:43:21,975
It breaks my heart
whenever I see things

565
00:43:21,975 --> 00:43:23,727
that remind me of her.

566
00:43:23,727 --> 00:43:26,062
Patricia, this is not easy
for me.

567
00:43:26,646 --> 00:43:28,356
But I have to function.

568
00:43:29,107 --> 00:43:31,985
Since when did La Familia
become your responsibility?

569
00:43:31,985 --> 00:43:35,196
I'm doing this because I know
how important La Familia is

570
00:43:35,196 --> 00:43:36,448
to Diana.

571
00:43:36,823 --> 00:43:39,534
I can't just wallow in sadness.

572
00:43:42,954 --> 00:43:44,831
Someone has to take care
of the company.

573
00:43:45,957 --> 00:43:47,876
I have also consulted
with the board and...

574
00:43:48,543 --> 00:43:50,086
they gave me their approval.

575
00:43:51,046 --> 00:43:55,050
And I've been asking the police
for updates about her, Patricia.

576
00:43:55,633 --> 00:43:57,844
You can confirm it
with the police.

577
00:43:58,595 --> 00:44:00,180
You should improve your acting.

578
00:44:04,601 --> 00:44:06,227
We still have something
to talk about.

579
00:44:10,982 --> 00:44:13,109
Here's your resignation letter.

580
00:44:13,109 --> 00:44:14,110
Just sign it.

581
00:44:25,580 --> 00:44:26,998
Resignation?

582
00:44:28,375 --> 00:44:30,335
You're terminating me?

583
00:44:30,335 --> 00:44:32,879
Patricia, please don't take it
in a bad way.

584
00:44:33,546 --> 00:44:35,507
I'm just finding you a way out.

585
00:44:35,507 --> 00:44:37,926
You're not in the right mind
to work.

586
00:44:38,426 --> 00:44:40,220
I'm just looking out for you.

587
00:44:40,720 --> 00:44:43,431
I don't need you
to look out for me.

588
00:44:44,474 --> 00:44:47,310
And I definitely
don't need to resign.

589
00:44:56,528 --> 00:45:00,031
I will never leave
my mother's company...

590
00:45:01,116 --> 00:45:03,576
our family's company.

591
00:45:04,869 --> 00:45:09,082
As her daughter,
I'll fight for it until the end.

592
00:45:09,290 --> 00:45:12,377
I'm also doing this
for our family.

593
00:45:12,377 --> 00:45:15,380
And it doesn't help
that you're defying me

594
00:45:15,380 --> 00:45:17,090
right in front of them.

595
00:45:17,090 --> 00:45:19,050
I learned this from Diana.

596
00:45:19,509 --> 00:45:21,928
This is damage control.

597
00:45:22,554 --> 00:45:25,974
As a family, we should have
a united front.

598
00:45:26,224 --> 00:45:28,518
You came into our lives
not long ago,

599
00:45:28,518 --> 00:45:30,145
and you're already considering
yourself as family?

600
00:45:30,854 --> 00:45:32,355
Damage control.

601
00:45:33,189 --> 00:45:34,399
Do you actually want to help,

602
00:45:34,399 --> 00:45:35,525
or is there something
you're afraid of--

603
00:45:35,525 --> 00:45:36,818
Hello!

604
00:45:38,445 --> 00:45:39,737
Oh, so...

605
00:45:39,737 --> 00:45:41,072
S-Sorry.

606
00:45:41,865 --> 00:45:43,241
Is this not a good time?

607
00:45:43,241 --> 00:45:44,242
I'll just come back later.

608
00:45:44,242 --> 00:45:45,452
Who are you?

609
00:45:45,827 --> 00:45:46,995
This is Sandra.

610
00:45:47,954 --> 00:45:49,372
She's my new secretary.

611
00:46:04,596 --> 00:46:05,597
Enzo.

612
00:46:07,015 --> 00:46:08,641
Can we talk?

613
00:46:08,641 --> 00:46:10,018
Not now, Patricia.

614
00:46:10,018 --> 00:46:11,478
You were right.

615
00:46:11,478 --> 00:46:12,937
She seems like a fighter.

616
00:46:12,937 --> 00:46:16,191
We both know her anger
won't go anywhere.

617
00:46:17,317 --> 00:46:19,611
Especially now that she
and Enzo aren't on good terms.

618
00:46:20,069 --> 00:46:22,530
She can't ask for his help now.

619
00:46:22,864 --> 00:46:24,199
Just be careful.

620
00:46:24,616 --> 00:46:27,076
You know what it feels like
to be an angry child.

621
00:46:27,785 --> 00:46:29,787
You're no different from her.

622
00:46:30,330 --> 00:46:32,123
When are you planning
to talk to me?

623
00:46:33,082 --> 00:46:35,001
It's not something for you
to decide.

624
00:46:45,845 --> 00:46:47,597
Leave us, Sandra.

625
00:46:54,854 --> 00:46:56,523
Yes, Enzo. I got your message.

626
00:46:56,523 --> 00:46:57,941
What do you want to talk about?

627
00:46:59,901 --> 00:47:01,528
I also want justice.

628
00:47:02,987 --> 00:47:04,405
For my family.

629
00:47:04,739 --> 00:47:06,282
I want to take revenge.

630
00:47:07,867 --> 00:47:09,869
And I know you can help me.

631
00:47:10,328 --> 00:47:11,829
Good to know.

632
00:47:14,040 --> 00:47:16,626
But I want to make sure
that you're certain.

633
00:47:17,710 --> 00:47:20,296
Because it's hard to go
against your heart.

634
00:47:22,632 --> 00:47:25,426
I lost my parents
because of their family.

635
00:47:26,803 --> 00:47:28,721
I let Miss D order me around.

636
00:47:29,389 --> 00:47:31,057
Out of gratitude.

637
00:47:31,641 --> 00:47:33,142
And most importantly,

638
00:47:33,560 --> 00:47:35,728
I trusted Patricia.

639
00:47:35,728 --> 00:47:37,855
But she had been lying to me
for a long time.

640
00:47:39,357 --> 00:47:41,442
My heart is not my enemy.

641
00:47:42,360 --> 00:47:43,403
It's them.

642
00:47:44,487 --> 00:47:46,197
I have a lot of plans.

643
00:47:46,698 --> 00:47:48,449
But first of all, I want to get

644
00:47:48,449 --> 00:47:51,035
the most important shareholders
in the company on my side.

645
00:47:51,035 --> 00:47:52,412
You know them, don't you?

646
00:47:53,204 --> 00:47:54,956
Mm-hmm. Is that all?

647
00:48:27,030 --> 00:48:29,407
I choose
to believe you, Patricia.

648
00:48:31,534 --> 00:48:33,244
You are not your mistakes.

649
00:48:34,287 --> 00:48:37,248
I didn't get justice
for my parents.

650
00:48:37,248 --> 00:48:40,126
But I know that you
also just want justice.

651
00:48:43,421 --> 00:48:45,214
So, for Miss D,

652
00:48:45,214 --> 00:48:46,799
for this company.

653
00:48:49,010 --> 00:48:50,386
and for you...

654
00:48:52,472 --> 00:48:53,723
I have a plan

655
00:48:54,641 --> 00:48:56,017
to get back at Ricardo.

656
00:48:59,187 --> 00:49:00,730
Come with me.

657
00:49:02,023 --> 00:49:03,566
Patricia, there's something
you need to know.

658
00:49:07,695 --> 00:49:08,738
Patricia.

659
00:49:09,405 --> 00:49:10,657
I found out...

660
00:49:11,824 --> 00:49:15,078
that everything that Sir Ricardo
said about his family,

661
00:49:16,412 --> 00:49:19,540
as well as all the documents
he gave to La Familia...

662
00:49:20,833 --> 00:49:22,543
It's all fabricated.

663
00:49:22,543 --> 00:49:24,045
Why did he do that?

664
00:49:24,587 --> 00:49:26,839
Because Ricardo is the son

665
00:49:26,839 --> 00:49:28,675
of Cecilia Pineda.

666
00:49:30,259 --> 00:49:33,805
The disgruntled employee
who was furious with Aragons.

667
00:49:33,805 --> 00:49:36,265
She was suspected to be the one
who set fire to the factory.

668
00:49:37,058 --> 00:49:38,601
He wants to take revenge.

669
00:49:38,976 --> 00:49:42,355
He told me about
Miss D's cover-up himself.

670
00:49:42,355 --> 00:49:45,233
Patricia, he has been watching
Miss D for a long time.

671
00:49:45,233 --> 00:49:47,235
We need to expose everything.

672
00:49:47,235 --> 00:49:48,653
We don't have proof

673
00:49:48,653 --> 00:49:50,822
that he did anything
harmful to Mama.

674
00:49:51,489 --> 00:49:54,826
We need solid evidence
against him.

675
00:49:55,410 --> 00:49:56,994
And that's what
we don't have yet.

676
00:49:57,370 --> 00:50:00,039
If we want to outsmart
Sir Ricardo,

677
00:50:00,832 --> 00:50:03,459
we need someone
who can get close to him.

678
00:50:04,085 --> 00:50:05,294
Me.

679
00:50:05,294 --> 00:50:06,629
I will approach him.

680
00:50:08,089 --> 00:50:09,799
I will pretend to be his ally

681
00:50:10,299 --> 00:50:14,178
until I get enough evidence
that we can use against him.

682
00:50:14,887 --> 00:50:18,349
We both know that Patricia
won't give up easily.

683
00:50:18,725 --> 00:50:21,477
I want you to find out
everything she knows,

684
00:50:21,477 --> 00:50:26,482
every move she'll make,
and her plans.

685
00:50:30,445 --> 00:50:31,946
I think he took our bait.

686
00:50:39,746 --> 00:50:42,290
But we still need
to be careful, okay?

687
00:50:43,082 --> 00:50:48,004
I'm sure he's already trying
to seize control of La Familia.

688
00:50:50,423 --> 00:50:52,133
He's already
on the move, Patricia.

689
00:50:52,133 --> 00:50:54,093
He is looking for a way

690
00:50:54,093 --> 00:50:56,971
to win the favor
of the company shareholders.

691
00:50:58,973 --> 00:51:00,433
We can't let that happen.

692
00:51:01,350 --> 00:51:03,352
We need to beat him to it.

693
00:51:08,983 --> 00:51:10,067
Sign it.

694
00:51:14,947 --> 00:51:16,991
"Share Transfer Agreement?"

695
00:51:16,991 --> 00:51:18,284
I won't sign that.

696
00:51:19,202 --> 00:51:20,995
Hey-- Hey! Stop!

697
00:51:20,995 --> 00:51:22,413
What are you doing?

698
00:51:22,413 --> 00:51:24,582
Stop! Let me go!

699
00:51:26,083 --> 00:51:27,043
What are you going to do?

700
00:51:27,960 --> 00:51:31,464
I have ten little fingers

701
00:51:31,881 --> 00:51:35,051
- I have hands and feet
- You're crazy...

702
00:51:35,510 --> 00:51:37,178
Let me go. Hey.

703
00:51:37,178 --> 00:51:38,137
Hey!

704
00:51:39,305 --> 00:51:43,142
1, 2, 3, 4...

705
00:51:43,559 --> 00:51:45,520
Stop! I'll sign it!

706
00:51:45,520 --> 00:51:46,437
I'll sign it.

707
00:51:47,939 --> 00:51:48,898
I'll sign it.

708
00:51:49,565 --> 00:51:51,400
That's better.

709
00:52:05,414 --> 00:52:06,541
Where are you going?

710
00:52:08,000 --> 00:52:10,586
Spend the night here
in my room. Hm?

711
00:52:10,586 --> 00:52:13,172
I'm... I'm sorry, sir.

712
00:52:14,423 --> 00:52:15,842
I think...

713
00:52:15,842 --> 00:52:18,761
we both got carried away?

714
00:52:18,761 --> 00:52:21,097
You're my boss.

715
00:52:21,097 --> 00:52:24,725
And I'm just your secretary.

716
00:52:25,977 --> 00:52:29,063
I know this may not make sense
to you, but...

717
00:52:30,648 --> 00:52:32,233
I've been trying to understand

718
00:52:32,233 --> 00:52:34,485
why I feel like this
towards you.

719
00:52:35,027 --> 00:52:39,156
You saved my life
from loneliness.

720
00:52:39,323 --> 00:52:42,785
You gave me something that I'd
stopped expecting from anyone.

721
00:52:43,119 --> 00:52:46,205
And these last few days, you've
made me feel really special.

722
00:52:47,039 --> 00:52:50,835
Sir, I did all those things

723
00:52:51,127 --> 00:52:52,545
because you were good to me

724
00:52:52,545 --> 00:52:56,507
and you were good
to my daughters.

725
00:52:56,799 --> 00:53:00,136
But you've made me feel like
I need never be alone again.

726
00:53:01,012 --> 00:53:02,013
I...

727
00:53:02,930 --> 00:53:05,349
I'm in love with you, Carlota.

728
00:53:06,017 --> 00:53:07,018
Carlota...

729
00:53:08,227 --> 00:53:09,270
marry me.

730
00:53:13,441 --> 00:53:15,026
I want you, Carlota.

731
00:53:16,319 --> 00:53:17,486
I need you.

732
00:53:18,946 --> 00:53:21,324
People will talk, sir.

733
00:53:21,324 --> 00:53:22,491
Let them.

734
00:53:22,491 --> 00:53:24,076
To hell with them.

735
00:53:24,994 --> 00:53:27,455
I want you.
I need you, Carlota.

736
00:53:27,705 --> 00:53:29,457
Mm-hmm?

737
00:53:34,962 --> 00:53:37,882
I suggest we review the
current management structure

738
00:53:37,882 --> 00:53:38,925
of the company.

739
00:53:39,425 --> 00:53:41,218
This includes people
who have access

740
00:53:41,218 --> 00:53:43,554
to confidential
company information.

741
00:53:43,554 --> 00:53:46,390
We also need to stabilize
our financial stand.

742
00:53:47,224 --> 00:53:48,935
Let's lay off some employees.

743
00:53:49,477 --> 00:53:50,728
I agree.

744
00:53:50,728 --> 00:53:55,274
We can't let La Familia get
caught up in another scandal.

745
00:53:56,108 --> 00:53:59,028
But Ricardo, the employees--

746
00:53:59,028 --> 00:54:03,157
They need to understand
that we're doing this

747
00:54:03,157 --> 00:54:04,575
for the company's sake.

748
00:54:06,118 --> 00:54:08,120
That's what we all want.

749
00:54:09,747 --> 00:54:11,832
To protect La Familia.

750
00:54:27,765 --> 00:54:29,517
"You're going to pay
for what you did!"

751
00:54:30,559 --> 00:54:34,063
"You'll never get La Familia!
You're just like your mother!"

752
00:54:40,653 --> 00:54:41,696
Ricardo?

753
00:54:42,780 --> 00:54:43,990
Are you okay?

754
00:55:02,717 --> 00:55:04,343
Enough with the games,
Patricia.

755
00:55:06,971 --> 00:55:08,305
What?

756
00:55:08,681 --> 00:55:10,558
I know you're the one
who's been messaging me.

757
00:55:22,695 --> 00:55:24,864
Why are you taking my phone?

758
00:55:27,199 --> 00:55:28,200
Give me that.

759
00:55:33,372 --> 00:55:35,833
You're hurting me, sir!

760
00:55:35,833 --> 00:55:37,877
Stop screaming.
I'm just trying to talk.

761
00:55:37,877 --> 00:55:39,879
Sir Ricardo...

762
00:55:42,506 --> 00:55:45,009
What's going on with you, sir?

763
00:55:48,429 --> 00:55:50,848
Sir Ricardo,
is there a problem?

764
00:56:03,694 --> 00:56:05,321
Patricia, are you okay?

765
00:56:05,946 --> 00:56:06,906
Hey...

766
00:56:10,993 --> 00:56:12,578
- Are you okay?
- Are you okay?

767
00:56:29,553 --> 00:56:30,805
Patricia...

768
00:56:33,224 --> 00:56:35,309
You shouldn't have done that.

769
00:56:36,143 --> 00:56:38,270
You didn't have to make a scene.

770
00:56:38,729 --> 00:56:41,649
I'm just trying to show
his true colors

771
00:56:42,233 --> 00:56:44,068
in front of other people.

772
00:56:44,360 --> 00:56:47,196
So when the police
talks to them,

773
00:56:47,571 --> 00:56:51,033
they'll remember this day
when Ricardo hurt me.

774
00:56:54,995 --> 00:56:56,163
It's just...

775
00:56:57,289 --> 00:56:59,333
I just don't want you
to get hurt.

776
00:57:02,294 --> 00:57:04,713
We need to get
more ammo against him

777
00:57:04,713 --> 00:57:07,716
while we're still looking
for solid proof.

778
00:57:07,925 --> 00:57:10,136
And I'll do anything I can
to get that.

779
00:57:11,137 --> 00:57:13,389
Being scared
won't get me anywhere.

780
00:57:18,060 --> 00:57:19,228
Don't worry.

781
00:57:19,770 --> 00:57:21,147
I'll be careful.

782
00:57:32,283 --> 00:57:33,284
Hello?

783
00:57:33,534 --> 00:57:35,619
Is this Patricia Dela Cruz?

784
00:57:35,828 --> 00:57:37,079
Yes. Who is this?

785
00:57:38,080 --> 00:57:40,082
I'm calling about Diana Aragon.

786
00:58:01,270 --> 00:58:02,271
What happened?

787
00:58:11,530 --> 00:58:13,490
That brat, Patricia.

788
00:58:20,414 --> 00:58:21,457
Carlota.

789
00:58:22,333 --> 00:58:23,459
Ricardo.

790
00:58:24,043 --> 00:58:26,712
Mr. Smith wants to marry me.

791
00:58:27,630 --> 00:58:30,633
And I have an offer for you.

792
00:58:31,425 --> 00:58:32,676
Alright, let's talk.

793
00:58:49,526 --> 00:58:50,819
Enzo.

794
00:58:50,819 --> 00:58:53,322
Sir Ricardo? There's something
you need to know.

795
00:58:53,739 --> 00:58:55,032
About Miss D.

796
00:58:55,699 --> 00:58:56,951
What about Diana?

797
00:58:57,326 --> 00:58:59,161
I was with Patricia earlier.

798
00:58:59,578 --> 00:59:00,955
Someone called her.

799
00:59:00,955 --> 00:59:02,873
They said they've found
Miss D's body.

800
00:59:02,873 --> 00:59:03,874
She's dead.

801
00:59:04,833 --> 00:59:05,918
Where is she?

802
00:59:06,252 --> 00:59:08,128
We're here at the morgue now.

803
00:59:08,629 --> 00:59:10,714
I'll send you the exact address.

804
00:59:14,260 --> 00:59:16,845
Ricardo, this is bad.

805
00:59:17,346 --> 00:59:18,973
Didn't you stab Diana?

806
00:59:19,598 --> 00:59:21,934
What if they found out
she died from that?

807
00:59:28,232 --> 00:59:29,650
My wife's urn is missing.

808
00:59:29,650 --> 00:59:33,362
I spent my whole life
sharing Mama with La Familia.

809
00:59:33,362 --> 00:59:34,738
Don't I have any rights?

810
00:59:34,738 --> 00:59:36,240
Then grieve with us.

811
00:59:36,240 --> 00:59:38,450
She's still planning
to take you down.

812
00:59:38,450 --> 00:59:39,868
I'm not going to stop

813
00:59:39,868 --> 00:59:42,037
until I completely erase her
from La Familia.

814
00:59:42,037 --> 00:59:44,164
This is what's written
on Diana's will.

815
00:59:44,164 --> 00:59:45,499
I said, let me go!

816
00:59:45,499 --> 00:59:48,294
You'll never take away
my right over La Familia!

817
00:59:48,294 --> 00:59:50,963
- What do you even know?
- You're just her husband.

818
00:59:50,963 --> 00:59:54,967
Never underestimate
what an Aragon can do.
